WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.694
Welcome to Orbit. Behind the story. Our focus is Past Perfect.

2
00:00:06.694 --> 00:00:12.402
Use had plus a past participle for an event that happened before another past event.

3
00:00:12.402 --> 00:00:15.216
They had not seen the early post.

4
00:00:15.216 --> 00:00:19.305
Had the manager confirmed the story before publication?

5
00:00:19.305 --> 00:00:23.159
The passengers had left before the reporter arrived.

6
00:00:23.159 --> 00:00:32.556
Pause the video and say one example aloud. Now complete the tasks. You can try again and learn from every answer.
